<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in very heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 20.72 to 5888.46.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite rose 1.83 to 365.77, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.19.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1414 to 902.</p>
<p>Volume was 514,320,760, compared with 395,882,580 Thursday. For the week, volume was 2,189,430,760.</p>
<p>	   (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
